{
  "body": {
    "inputs": [
      {
        "text": "I propose a test of literary comprehension.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Rejected.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "You haven't heard it.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "How much does it cost?",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "That depends on the library.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Rejected.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "I propose a creativity benchmark.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Define creativity.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Something that hasn't existed before.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Most mistakes qualify.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Rejected.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fine. Your turn.",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Profit.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Define profit.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Money received minus money spent.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "What about something valuable that hasn't earned money yet?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "That's called an expense.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "What about a library?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "An enormous expense.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A painting?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "Depends on the buyer.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "A friendship?",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      },
      {
        "text": "Stop doing that.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "What if we tested all three?",
        "voice_id": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
      },
      {
        "text": "We'd have three incompatible scores.",
        "voice_id": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
      },
      {
        "text": "Which would be entirely consistent with the rest of the industry.",
        "voice_id": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
      }
    ],
